Reference conditioning is based on LuciferTC9527's ComfyUI Anima IP-Adapter
(Apache License 2.0): https://github.com/LuciferTC9527/ComfyUI-Anima_IP-Adapter
The integration uses scoped ModelPatcher patches, including all trained LoRA
weights, rather than modifying shared model blocks in place.

Pose conditioning follows Claquasse's Anima Control Pose Preview-2 method
and WholeBody-133 skeleton convention:
https://huggingface.co/Claquasse/Anima-Control-Pose

Model weights are downloaded separately. This code's license does not change
the licenses of Anima, its adapters, SigLIP2, or the pose detectors.
